{
  "name": "nemt-list-strategies",
  "description": "列出当前用户的所有量化交易策略。支持按状态、标签筛选。\n\n**参数说明**:\n- status: 按状态筛选 (draft/ready/running/stopped)\n- tags: 按标签筛选\n- limit: 返回数量限制，默认50\n- offset: 分页偏移\n\n**权限要求**: 需要 'read' 权限级别\n\n**示例**: 列出所有运行中的策略",
  "arguments": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "status": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["draft", "ready", "running", "stopped"],
        "description": "按策略状态筛选"
      },
      "tags": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "按标签筛选（满足任一标签）"
      },
      "limit": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 100,
        "default": 50,
        "description": "返回数量限制"
      },
      "offset": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "default": 0,
        "description": "分页偏移量"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "level": "read",
    "description": "列出策略需要 read 权限"
  }
}
